      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ES_EH_Spark_test on F8 fabricessparktest8; Eventstream, Eventhouse, Lakehouse and notebooks.\nWorkspace Private Link via pl-fabric-esehspark and customer-VNet workspace private endpoint.\nSpark MPE mpe-esehspark-score-api -> Function private-link target (sites).\nSpark MPE mpe-esehsparkkv -> Key Vault private-link target (vault).\nDerived custom-endpoint Kafka route resolves privately; no separately owned Event Hubs namespace.\nConfigured max: 5 executors; observed test peak: 2 executors + driver = 24 total cores.",
      "originalText": "ES_EH_Spark_test on F8 fabricessparktest8; Eventstream, Eventhouse, Lakehouse and notebooks.\nWorkspace Private Link via pl-fabric-esehspark and customer-VNet workspace private endpoint.\nSpark MPE mpe-esehspark-score-api -> Function private-link target (sites).\nSpark MPE mpe-esehsparkkv -> Key Vault private-link target (vault).\nDerived custom-endpoint Kafka route resolves privately; no separately owned Event Hubs namespace.\nConfigured max: 5 executors; observed test peak: 2 executors + driver = 24 total cores.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
