      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Azure resource names/types refreshed by read-only ARM inventory on 2026-11-05; links checked against deployed source and retained private-route evidence.\nFabric behavior/security state reflects the latest verified session evidence; no new load, endpoint probe, policy change or cloud write was performed for this document.\nOnly Azure resources belong to rg_esehspark. Fabric workspace contents are represented alongside it for architecture context, not as ARM child resources.",
      "originalText": "Azure resource names/types refreshed by read-only ARM inventory on 2026-11-05; links checked against deployed source and retained private-route evidence.\nFabric behavior/security state reflects the latest verified session evidence; no new load, endpoint probe, policy change or cloud write was performed for this document.\nOnly Azure resources belong to rg_esehspark. Fabric workspace contents are represented alongside it for architecture context, not as ARM child resources.",
